        {
          "_key": "f4724c70bbb7",
          "text": "Buying property",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "ddbc6c6f3652"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "1a2f6bb08824",
          "text": " abroad is a major financial and lifestyle decision. Whether the goal is relocation, investment, retirement planning, or securing a holiday home, every buyer faces unique challenges, priorities, and expectations. Understanding how others approached the process can provide valuable insight and confidence.",
