    {
      "_key": "0fcb39c81971",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6a62019f2c88",
          "text": "The case studies featured on this page highlight how different families evaluated these factors and selected properties that supported their lifestyle goals while maintaining strong long-term value.",
