    {
      "_key": "8859708da613",
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f0b352ba1398",
          "text": "International investors often seek opportunities that combine capital appreciation potential, rental demand, asset security, and geographical diversification. New developments, luxury properties, and carefully selected residential assets can serve different investment objectives depending on the buyer's risk profile and time horizon.",
